{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一条大号白色粗体句子首先进入视线，字号大、亮度高、位置靠前；随后容易注意到下面几条同样醒目的白色粗体句子。右上角绿色目录项相对较小。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去曾经自然亲近的日子，重新感到温暖，也盼望以后还能有那样的亲近关系。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、心里重新发热、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他后来想到未来可能仍然孤单，平静中仍有疑问，最终决定即使没有人再亲近自己，也要好好生活，不再为了留住别人而委屈自己。这一层转变和最终决心不是第一眼能直接抓到的。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的白色粗体句子争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在四块文字里，要拼接才能看出从怀念、重新振作、担忧孤单到决定好好生活的变化。\",\n    \"最后一块句子较长，包含有人愿意亲近和始终没有人亲近两种条件，以及对应的不同态度。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7bcce9f1-a70d-4529-84f0-6173279e48be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T033141054469Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:32:07.435869+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8df77a6acf448a63177d3fa4b06e5716edd22b98b019e4145de9a76d54ae9354", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc